  "headline": "FDA's records show a registered plant on our spironolactone labels received a Warning Letter 2010-04-08 and an OAI inspection 2009-06-11; the most recent inspection 2026-07-16 was VAI",
  "headline_cites": ["E17", "E8", "E16"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Our spironolactone supply includes product labeled by Bryant Ranch Prepack, which operates a registered plant at FEI 1000519407.",
      "cites": ["E18"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspected that plant on 2009-06-11 and classified the inspection OAI, with the classification known on 2009-09-09.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA issued a Warning Letter to the same plant on 2010-04-08.",
      "cites": ["E17"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent inspections in 2010, 2011, 2013, 2016, 2019, 2022, 2024, and 2026 were all classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E9", "E10", "E11", "E12", "E13", "E14", "E15", "E16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The most recent inspection ended 2026-07-16 and was classified VAI, with the classification known on 2026-10-14.",
      "cites": ["E16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list shows Pfizer Inc. spironolactone tablets posted as To Be Discontinued on 2025-12-10.",
      "cites": ["E19"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 13 days on hand, Corvale General 25 days, and Corvale Lakeside 10 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    }
  ]
}
